  "releaseNotes": "- Engine: Fixes minor memory leaks for Audio/Video devices\n\t\t- Seek: Stability and performance improvements\n\t\t- HTTP/HLS: Stability improvements\n\t\t- VideoDecoder: Fixes a possible infinite loop during draining\n\n\t\t[Breaking Changes]\n\t\t- Player.Keys: Introduces OpenPrevItem / OpenNextItem (Ctrl + Up / Down)\n\t\t- Config.Demuxer.FormatOpt: Resets / Minimizes initial format options (Deprecates/defaults: probesize, analyzeduration, extension_picky, reconnect, reconnect_streamed, reconnect_delay_max, rtsp_transport)",
